cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this database, please cite it together with its upstream
  sources (EU-NED, CLEA, and — if you use the flags — PopuList).
title: "European National Elections at NUTS Level, 1983-2025"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Schallmeiner
    given-names: Alexander
    email: schallmeiner.a1@gmail.com
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-26"
abstract: >-
  Party-level results of national parliamentary (lower-chamber) elections
  for 32 European countries, 254 elections, 1983-2025, harmonised to NUTS
  territorial units in three NUTS vintages (2016, 2021, 2024) with
  party-family classification and time-aware PopuList flags.
